      "overview": "C2 moves past the mechanics of grammar into control of style: complex syntax and inversion, literary and archaic register, precise collocations, cohesive devices for long texts, hedging and nuanced modality, and awareness of Italy's real linguistic variety. This is fluency as judgment, not just correctness.",
